Recommends: konsole, nano
Description: Colour Vision page for System Settings
 One choice for the person's colour vision (none, protan, deutan, tritan or
 monochromacy) sets KWin's colour correction and a colour scheme that keeps
 the colours that carry meaning apart, and, when chosen, Konsole, nano and the
 text console. The person's own settings are kept and come back exactly when
 the choice returns to none; what could not be set is said on the page.
